t", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:39:29Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Sukhdev it is", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:39:46Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "KP 45 Sal 20 Farhan 5 Akshay 20 Tapish 10", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:39:54Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Haan ye kyun marenge ye toh 15 ko maar ke marenge", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:40:31Z", "username": "Farhan", "text": "Why do I recall similar dialogue in legend of Bhagat Singh", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:40:37Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Another nice dialogue", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:41:35Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Notably he only had a problem with brown people maaroing", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:41:41Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "There is a story that while drafting \"To the young political workers\" Singh was interrupted by a fellow prisoner who asked why he was bothering with \"party tactics\" when he was about to die. Singh replied, \"I am not writing for my life; I am writing for the life of the movement.\" He spent his final days not in prayer, but in meticulous editing to ensure his message to the youth was logically sound and impossible to misinterpret.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:41:47Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Haan sahi mein ‎", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:41:48Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Ww1 mein bade hi enthusiastic recruiter the gandhiji", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:41:49Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Piyush Mishra wrote it, and read all his essays before he wrote the script", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:42:39Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Mast questions!! Thanks @⁨Abhishek Vats⁩", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:42:43Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Thank you! 🙏🙌", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:42:43Z", "username": "Farhan", "text": "Maza aa gaya @⁨Abhishek Vats⁩ !", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:42:52Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Lovely revisit to one of the lives I truly enjoy knowing more and more about! Thanks Vats!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:42:55Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I had a leftish phase in college jab id devoured all his pamphlets", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:43:16Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I cant say i agree with most of it anymore :p but truly an extremely sharp mind a great son of india", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:43:23Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Same 😅", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:43:23Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "This was truly an amazing set, gotta go back and read the morning one too now. And such a solemn one, not one wisecrack by anyone through it.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:44:29Z", "username": "Radhika", "text": "Brilliant set, @⁨Abhishek Vats⁩. Thank you. Truly inspiring to revisit his work, even if briefly", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:46:07Z", "username": "Radhika", "text": "Can only imagine how much you read to prepare this one. Good nudge for me to revisit too", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:46:43Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "I think the context is important for his essays. Some of the concepts were relevant then maybe not to that extent now. But the social commentary still stands today.\nAlso he evolved so much as he progressed and maybe would have refined his thoughts further. Not to forget he was only 23 when he was martyred", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:47:00Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Superb set @⁨Abhishek Vats⁩!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:47:32Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Yes 100%. He was only 21 when he wrote most of his greatest essays, and was operating with the information he had at the time", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:47:38Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Esp RE ussr and bolshevism", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:47:43Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Yup", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:48:22Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "This reminds me of a funny story", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:48:41Z", "username": "Farhan", "text": "I searched Bhagat Singh Essays on Google😭", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]